cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  From 5 PMUs to 122 Buses: Machine Learning for Fault Location in Active
  Distribution Networks
message: >-
  If you use this software or the associated dataset, please cite both the
  software and the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Fernando José Kurabayashi
    family-names: Barreira
    email: fernando.barreira@unesp.br
