repository-code: 'https://github.com/fernando-barreira/ieee123-ml-fault-location'
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a machine-learning study of multi-class fault-bus
  identification on the IEEE 123-bus distribution feeder with distributed
  generation, using sparse PMU measurements. Includes the OpenDSS Monte-Carlo
  simulation campaign, physics-informed feature engineering, algorithmic PMU
  placement by Forward Selection with Neighborhood Refinement, and the
  training and evaluation protocol.
keywords:
  - fault location
  - distribution networks
  - distributed generation
  - phasor measurement units
  - PMU placement
  - OpenDSS
  - IEEE 123-bus
  - deep learning
  - symmetrical components
license: MIT
